<mxCell id="note" value="Input U [L,D]; Q/K/V [L,D] are calculated, not stored trained parameters. H heads; d = D/H.&lt;br&gt;Finish all Q, K, V first. For each head/query: score → softmax → weighted values. Then project all joined Z tokens to O.&lt;br&gt;One score/probability row is reused only after its d weighted-value results are stored. Head joining is address layout, not copying." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
