<mxCell id="note" value="For each selected projection A: A[t,j] = QACT(bA[j] + Σ U[t,f] WA[j,f]). Q first, then K, then V.&lt;br&gt;Output bank changes with the selected projection. Shared linear owns all result writes; this controller must not duplicate them.&lt;br&gt;Matrix rows are stored output-major. No mask, GELU or softmax inside these projections." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
