<mxCell id="note" value="Z[i,h·d+r] = QACT(Σⱼ p[j] V[j,h·d+r]), for r=0..d−1. No bias or extra scaling.&lt;br&gt;Dot operand A: probability base, stride 1. Operand B: V base + h·d+r, stride D. Length L, initial sum zero.&lt;br&gt;Probability is unsigned and V is signed: zero-extend probability, sign-extend V; keep a widened signed accumulator." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
