<mxCell id="note" value="These four blocks are alternatives, not a chain. Each has its own request/result controller and is called only when needed.&lt;br&gt;RSQRT input positive variance+epsilon; EXP input ≤ 0; RECIP input positive; GELU input signed activation.&lt;br&gt;Algorithms, ranges, coefficients, bit counts and error bounds remain to be designed before RTL; no Taylor method is frozen." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
